{
    "about": "Every control of the Bible Note editor's toolbar (the bible-note package, as mounted in this app's note window), and what the chatbot does for it through owa_note_edit. An item with `change` is COVERED when src/helper/agentNoteToolbarParity.test.ts has a passing test named `toolbar: <id>`; an item with `excluded` carries its reason (none left). `label` is the editor's own words (aria-label or menu text), `aliases` its other words -- scripts/toolbar-coverage.mjs reads the package for labels this list does not have yet (leads).",
